# Database Schema

Ref: `supabase/migrations/20250222000000_initial_schema.sql`

**Tabelas:** resumes (id, user_id, parsed_data JSONB → ResumeData). analyses (id, user_id, resume_id, job_snapshot, score, matched_skills, missing_technical_skills, missing_behavioral_skills, status pending|completed|abandoned). user_credits (user_id, credits). purchases (id, stripe_session_id UNIQUE, user_id, package_id, credits_granted) — só service client. optimized_documents (id, analysis_id, file_path, format pdf|docx).

**Mapping:** parsed_data → resumeDataSchema; job_snapshot → jobSnapshotSchema; matched/missing_skills = string[]; status em runGapAnalysis/synthesizeOptimizedResumeForPreview.

**RLS:** resumes, analyses, user_credits = auth.uid()=user_id. purchases = sem policies, só service client. optimized_documents = via analysis.
